{
  "key": "letter-341-part-03",
  "number": 341,
  "generationId": "01a1e914-3c92-7fc3-855d-3b7edd804c49",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Either one can be a name or a reality, and no one can be both simultaneously.",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/21.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.485918
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Really be a name - and your reality is lost.",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/22.mp3",
      "start": 5.731066,
      "end": 8.55966
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Really be a reality - and your name is just a dream, maya.",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/23.mp3",
      "start": 9.726349,
      "end": 13.294082
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "And what nonsense to be a swami!",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/24.mp3",
      "start": 14.493537000000002,
      "end": 16.24483
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "But once one is at ease with the no-sense one transcends it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/25.mp3",
      "start": 17.490181,
      "end": 20.651791
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Please!",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/26.mp3",
      "start": 22.132562,
      "end": 22.902018
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Don't try to be sensible otherwise you will never have any sense at all - because only stupidity tries to be sensible!",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/27.mp3",
      "start": 24.406667,
      "end": 31.410816
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "The existence is absurd and meaningless and irrational - and that is why it is so beautiful, and to be in it, such a blessing!",
      "path": "audio/1971-341/28.mp3",
      "start": 32.875465000000005,
      "end": 42.63
    }
  ]
}
